Third-party components
----------------------

Stockfish (https://stockfishchess.org) is licensed separately under the GNU
General Public License v3 and is not covered by OpenChess's MIT license.

- The web app serves an unmodified build of Stockfish 18 (WASM) from
  apps/web/public/engines/. It runs as a separate Web Worker and is spoken to
  only over UCI. Source and license: apps/web/public/ENGINE.md.
- The native client and the house bot talk to a separately installed Stockfish
  binary, again only as a separate process over UCI.

Chess piece artwork under apps/web/public/piece/ is used under the licenses
recorded in apps/web/public/piece/CREDITS.md.

Opening books under apps/web/public/books/ are composed for this project; see
apps/web/public/books/BOOKS.md.
